ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te guardas la cápsula junto
con tus cartas?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Bien pensado!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ahora no me falles, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Honestly,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I was looking forward to
opening it back up,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} but I guess we
can't do anything about it now.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tenía muchas ganas de abrirla,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} pero
has tardado tanto{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} que ya se me han
pasado.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Speaking of which,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} I seemed to put
in {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oh, and also this fancy letter!

{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} This is a bit embarrassing!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I should've put a bit more thought
into writing it, huh?! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Capperi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} è a dir poco imbarazzante!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Forse ci avrei dovuto mettere più
impegno! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Da hätte ich mir vielleicht etwas
mehr Mühe geben sollen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Schließlich
war der Brief für mich! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Bu biraz utandırıcı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yazarken biraz daha
düşünseymişim, ha?! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'll give this to you as a thank-you.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
So here ya go—one recently dug
gift: {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sağ ol!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Biraz sonra
postanı kontrol et;
teşekkür için bir şey yollayacağım!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Anda,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}si me has desenterrado la
cápsula del tiempo y todo.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ya ni me acordaba de ella.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Gracias! Vamos a abrirla, ¿vale?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hä?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Was für eine Zeitkapsel?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ach ja, die hatte ich ganz vergessen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Machen wir sie auf!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}What was I trying to say?!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}I should
really take more time when writing
stuff, huh?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Qu'est-ce que j'ai bien pu vouloir
